// VabaxOS (ADR-0020): APT reads its sources only from sources.list.d, where
// vabaxos-apt puts Debian at a date checked by VabaxOS and the VabaxOS
// archive. /etc/apt/sources.list is written by the installer and by
// live-build with Debian testing day by day, which VabaxOS does not follow.
// To use it again, delete this file.
Dir::Etc::SourceList "/usr/share/vabaxos-apt/sources.list";

// The Release files of a past date of snapshot.debian.org are past their
// Valid-Until date: APT must not reject them. Here, not as an option of the
// source in vabaxos-debian.sources: while the ISO is built, live-build has
// its own source for the same address without that option, and APT stops
// on the two different values (CI, 2026-09-26). The same setting as
// image/config/archives/snapshot.conf.chroot.
Acquire::Check-Valid-Until "false";
